From: Matthijs Vader <mvader@victronenergy.com>
Subject: [PATCH] package.json: remove the optional @node-rs/bcrypt

npm-online-install installs no optional dependencies. Node-RED uses
bcryptjs when @node-rs/bcrypt is missing, as it has been on a GX since
July 2025.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Venus OS specific]
---
--- a/package.json
+++ b/package.json
@@ -44,9 +44,6 @@
         "nopt": "5.0.0",
         "semver": "7.8.5"
     },
-    "optionalDependencies": {
-        "@node-rs/bcrypt": "1.10.7"
-    },
     "engines": {
         "node": ">=22.9"
     }
